    docs(DESIGN): cite the grep form that reproduces the four-hit claim. Addresses CF-202.
    
    The step-2 cell cited `grep -rniE 'envelope|ack|inbox|lease|redeliver' scripts/` as returning
    four hits. Run verbatim that returns 12, because without a word boundary `ack` also matches
    "back", "backend" and "fall back"; the four-hit figure needs the `\b` and the `--include` filters.
    The Tier-2 judge (verdict ccdd5597) refuted exactly that cell; this commit makes the printed
    command the reproducing one and adds the third judge round to the audit file.
    
    Tier 1 for the closing run is the gitreins guard; the pre-commit hook is bypassed for the same
    docs-only reason disclosed in the parent commit (CF-031 precedent).
